## Model card

- **Name:** MiniMax M3.1 Flash Preview
- **Short description:** MiniMax's preview-tier multimodal coding model released in September 2026, featuring 1M context window, text/image/video input, and five effort levels accessible exclusively via MiniMax Code and Token Plan.
- **Provider / access:** MiniMax Code / Token Plan (`minimax-ai/minimax-m3.1-flash-preview`).
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-27 release; knowledge cutoff mid-2026.
- **IDs:** `minimax-ai/minimax-m3.1-flash-preview`. No Zen Free ID; plan-only access.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens total (1M context window); max output 65,536 tokens.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, and video input; text and code output; five configurable reasoning effort levels.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09):** No public per-token API pricing published; bundled under MiniMax Code subscription plans.
- **Architecture:** Unannounced proprietary mixture-of-experts multimodal architecture.

